Z||000003||Cliff Pennock||06-30-2000||05:52 PM||||It really is very simple. I saw you got the upload part right. After you upload an image, press CTRL-V in your message. And don't edit whatever it is PIP inserts in your message. For best results, if you post more than one image in the same message, press CTRL-V on a new line.||||reg||1
